        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml Copa_del_Mare_UseCases\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\n\nactor \&quot;Client\&quot; as CL\nactor \&quot;Serveur\&quot; as SV\nactor \&quot;Cuisinier / Barman\&quot; as CU\nactor \&quot;Caissier\&quot; as CA\nactor \&quot;Responsable des stocks\&quot; as RS\nactor \&quot;Service d&#39;achats\&quot; as AC\nactor \&quot;Livreur\&quot; as LV\nactor \&quot;Gérant / Administrateur\&quot; as GE\nactor \&quot;Glovo\&quot; as GL &lt;&lt;système&gt;&gt;\nactor \&quot;Wave / Mobile Money\&quot; as WV &lt;&lt;système&gt;&gt;\n\nrectangle \&quot;Solution de gestion — Copa del Mare\&quot; {\n\n  &#39; --- Réservations &amp; tables\n  usecase \&quot;Consulter le plan de salle\&quot; as UC01\n  usecase \&quot;Gérer les réservations\&quot; as UC02\n  usecase \&quot;Payer un acompte de réservation\&quot; as UC03\n\n  &#39; --- Commande\n  usecase \&quot;Prendre une commande\&quot; as UC04\n  usecase \&quot;Commander via QR code\&quot; as UC05\n  usecase \&quot;Enregistrer une commande téléphonique\&quot; as UC06\n  usecase \&quot;Recevoir une commande Glovo\&quot; as UC07\n\n  &#39; --- Cuisine\n  usecase \&quot;Suivre la préparation (KDS)\&quot; as UC08\n  usecase \&quot;Notifier le serveur (plat prêt)\&quot; as UC09\n\n  &#39; --- Caisse\n  usecase \&quot;Encaisser et facturer\&quot; as UC10\n  usecase \&quot;Clôturer la caisse\&quot; as UC11\n  usecase \&quot;Gérer les remises et offrandes\&quot; as UC12\n\n  &#39; --- Carte &amp; produits\n  usecase \&quot;Gérer la carte et les prix\&quot; as UC13\n  usecase \&quot;Gérer le poisson du jour\&quot; as UC14\n\n  &#39; --- Stocks &amp; achats\n  usecase \&quot;Suivre les stocks\&quot; as UC15\n  usecase \&quot;Faire un inventaire\&quot; as UC16\n  usecase \&quot;Exprimer un besoin d&#39;achat\&quot; as UC17\n  usecase \&quot;Éditer et suivre un bon de commande\&quot; as UC18\n  usecase \&quot;